Dataset Notice

The 200-row sample at data/sample/credit_risk_sample_200.csv is derived from the
"Credit Score Classification Dataset" by Rohan Paris (Kaggle, 2022), licensed
under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/parisrohan/credit-score-classification

The MIT License above applies to the original code in this repository. It does
not apply to the sampled dataset, which remains under its original CC BY 4.0
licence and requires attribution to Rohan Paris on reuse. The full 100,000-row
dataset is not redistributed in this repository — see the README for
instructions on downloading it directly from Kaggle.
